WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.600
Narrator: Half-time. The stand is emptying.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.400
Narrator: Noura spots a backpack under a seat - and nobody is near it.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.900
Narrator: Most bags like this are just forgotten.

4
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.300
Narrator: But some are not.

